description:
Links two of the reader's saved quotes in ReadingRate, with an optional line on why they belong together. The link is two-way and shows on both quotes in the app. Linking two quotes that are already linked changes nothing.

Use only when the reader asks to link two quotes, or says yes to linking them. To propose a link the reader has not asked for, use suggest_quote_link.

Example: {"quote_id": "<quote id>", "linked_quote_id": "<quote id>", "note": "Both ask how wide the present is."}
